# Phone + Desktop Required

My Cookbook must work on both phone and computer. Treat this as a hard requirement for every UI change.

## Always

- Keep `viewport` meta (`width=device-width, initial-scale=1`) on all HTML pages
- Mobile-first layout; enhance at existing breakpoints in `css/styles.css` (`min-width: 700px` / `800px`)
- Touch-friendly controls: adequate tap targets; no hover-only critical actions
- Avoid fixed widths that break narrow screens; keep images fluid (`max-width: 100%`)

## Before finishing UI work

- Sanity-check narrow (~375px) and wide (~1100px) layouts for the changed screens
- Forms, headers, grids, and cook tools must stay usable without horizontal scroll on a phone
